<title>ITALY: Italian mutual funds August inflow falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Italian mutual funds August inflow falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian investment funds had a net inflow of 4.697 trillion lire in August, compared with a net inflow of 6.874 trillion lire in July, Assogestioni, the industry body said.</p>
<p>Assogestioni said in a statement the lower inflow was entirely due to the fact August is a traditional holiday month.  </p>
<p>					August 1996    July 96</p>
<p> Redemptions (bln lire)	   3,055	  5,599</p>
<p> Subscriptions			7,752	 12,473</p>
<p>Net inflow, outflow (-) from:</p>
<p> Equity funds			   -52	   -315</p>
<p>     of which Italian		 -30	   -124</p>
<p> Bond funds			   4,888	  7,394</p>
<p> Mixed funds			   -139	   -205</p>
<p>-- Milan bureau +392 66129589</p>
